<title>UK: GECC adds 50 million stg to December 1999 bond.</title>
<headline>GECC adds 50 million stg to December 1999 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond increase was announced by lead manager ABN Amro Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL ELECTRIC CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT   *150 MLN STG   COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    30.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.3705  PAY DATE  **03.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.183    SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     *ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 100 MLN STG ON 21.OCT.96 AT</p>
<p>		AN ISSUE PRICE OF 100.7775</p>
<p>	    **PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST.</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC   1.1875</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.0 PCT 1999 GILT</p>
<p> NOTES	FUNGIBLE 40 DAYS AFTER PAYMENT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
